{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>Blood Pressure Log – VaraCare 是一款以私隱為先的心血管健康紀錄工具，適合需要管理高血壓、糖尿病或整理覆診資料的人士，集中記錄血壓、心跳與血糖。它將讀數整理成清晰趨勢，所有健康資料只留在 iPhone 本機。原價 US $12.99 的終生版<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>中，內購限時免費。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-85.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>血壓心跳血糖一站紀錄</h2>\n<p>可快速輸入收縮壓、舒張壓與靜止脈搏，自動分辨血壓分期，並計算平均動脈壓與脈壓差。引導式測量會提示坐姿、手臂位置與休息倒數，協助取得更穩定讀數；亦可記錄症狀、服藥與鈉攝取，追蹤血糖，並匯出供醫生閱讀的 PDF 或 CSV 報告。程式屬自我監測紀錄，不能直接測量血壓或取代醫療診斷。</p>\n<figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-520-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-521-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-522-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-523-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-524-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure></figure>\n<h2>限時免費領取終生版</h2>\n<p>Blood Pressure Log – VaraCare 終生版內購限時免費中，用戶完成初始化後看到收費牆，Lifetime 價格顯示為$0 即可免費收下。注意，如果看到價格不是 $0 代表限免已完結，請勿按付費確認。</p>\n<ul><li>應用名稱：Blood Pressure Log – VaraCare</li><li>應用類別：Health &amp; Fitness</li><li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/blood-pressure-log-varacare/id6808067686\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li></ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-10-26T04:20:26.538712+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":495,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-26T01:26:25+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-26T13:26:01.110008+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-26T04:13:53.262839+00:00","content_hash":"ac35c67aa40eb8702f1b37332f221e5ed437e9601307ba2e4d455a7db2e9b3f2","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}